# IAM Fundamentals

## Overview

This lab demonstrates foundational Identity and Access Management concepts through hands-on exercises and a simulated enterprise access-control scenario.

The lab covers:

- Identification
- Authentication
- Multi-Factor Authentication
- Authorization
- Access Control
- RBAC
- ABAC
- Least Privilege
- Single Sign-On
- Identity Lifecycle
- IAM Logging
- IAM Auditing

