## Objectives

- Understand the IAM lifecycle
- Differentiate identification, authentication, and authorization
- Understand MFA and authentication methods
- Apply least-privilege principles
- Understand RBAC and ABAC
- Understand SSO
- Identify IAM security risks
- Understand IAM monitoring and auditing

